cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TCM-BO, please cite it as below."
title: "A bilingual ontology of traditional Chinese medicine body structures aligned with ICD-11, FMA and SNOMED CT"
abstract: "TCM-BO is a bilingual (Chinese-English) OWL 2 DL ontology of traditional Chinese medicine body structures, aligned with ICD-11, FMA and SNOMED CT. It formalises TCM-specific structural relations that have no biomedical analogue, supplies an auditable typed cross-terminology mapping layer, and documents a reproducible quality-control, mapping-audit and label-governance methodology."
